              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Fig. 6.12: (a) Rubber band slightly stretched between your forefinger and thumb, (b) marks A, B, C on the surface, and (c) rubber band stretched back to point C with stack of 4 coins"
                }
